      "readOnlyHint": true,
      "title": "Read BeatScope visual state"
    },
    "description": "Visual state at one audio instant, computed by the shared JavaScript runtime: bar, beat, beatIndex, beat/bar phases, low/mid/high/all energy, onset impulse, accent, section. Mirrors the web player's track.at(time) exactly; null onset age or accent means no previous onset exists.",
